This licence covers PromptCAD's own code and artwork: the build scripts,
the launcher, the distribution layer under overlay/, the branding sources
and the installer script.

It does NOT cover the software PromptCAD bundles at build time, which is
redistributed under its own licence and is not part of this repository:

  * FreeCAD - LGPL-2.1-or-later, redistributed verbatim and unmodified.
  * llama.cpp - MIT, redistributed as an unmodified upstream release build.

Nor does it cover any model weights. None ship with PromptCAD and none are
in this repository; each model is published by its authors under its own
licence, which governs your use of it. See the Models section of README.md.

legal/NOTICE.txt carries the full picture and legal/SOURCE-OFFER.txt the
LGPL source offer that accompanies the built installer.
